## 4. ALWAYS mark clickable table rows with .tr-link

### ❌ Forbidden:
```js
tr.style.cursor = 'pointer'
tr.addEventListener('click', () => openDetail(id))
// no class added
```

### ✅ Required:
```js
tr.classList.add('tr-link')
tr.addEventListener('click', () => openDetail(id))
```

The class `.tr-link` is defined in `cosmos-ui-polish.css`.
It adds: `cursor: pointer`, blue hover background, and a `›` arrow on the right that appears on hover.
Never add custom hover styles to rows — use this class instead.

