## 6. ALWAYS animate stat card numbers with countUp

### ❌ Forbidden:
```js
document.getElementById('stat-total-skus').textContent = data.totalSkus
statEl.innerHTML = `<div class="sv">${count}</div>`
```

### ✅ Required — for integer and currency dashboard stats:
```js
const el = document.getElementById('stat-total-skus').querySelector('.sv')
cosmosCountUp(el, data.totalSkus)

// For currency values, add data-format="currency" to the element in HTML:
// <div class="sv" data-format="currency"></div>
// Then:
cosmosCountUp(currencyEl, data.totalRevenue)  // will prefix ₹ automatically
```

`cosmosCountUp()` is defined in `src/public/js/cosmos-ui-polish.js`.
Only apply to integer and currency `.sv` elements.
Do not apply to text values, percentages, or status badges.

