## 8. Required file links in every HTML page

Every HTML page served from `src/public/` MUST include these two lines before `</head>`:

```html
<link  rel="stylesheet" href="/css/cosmos-ui-polish.css">
<script src="/js/cosmos-ui-polish.js" defer></script>
```

This applies to:
- `src/public/foundry.html`
- `src/public/command-unit.html`
- `src/public/login.html`
- Any new HTML page created in `src/public/`

And to the root-level prototype files used in development:
- `Foundry_Prototype.html`
- `StorePilot_Prototype.html`
- `CommandUnit_Prototype.html`
- `Finance_Prototype.html`

If you create a new HTML page and forget to add these links, none of the polish rules will work.

