## 10. Empty states must have an action

### ❌ Forbidden — emoji + text only:
```html
<div class="empty">
  <div class="empty-ic">📦</div>
  <div>No items found</div>
</div>
```

### ✅ Required — icon + headline + subtext + action button where relevant:
```html
<div class="empty">
  <div class="empty-ic">📦</div>
  <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:6px">No purchases yet</div>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:16px">Register your first purchase to get started.</div>
  <button class="btn primary" onclick="openM('modal-new-purchase')">+ New Purchase</button>
</div>
```

If there is no meaningful action for an empty state (e.g. audit logs with no records), the button is optional.
The headline and subtext are always required.

